{"id":"n73239-1-7","stage":1,"title":"환영 · 欢迎","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73239-1-7-1","ko":"선생님 댁에 한번 찾아 뵙겠습니다.","zh":"我打算去老师家里拜访您一次。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님","meaning":"先生","explanation":"선생님：先生。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"2","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}},{"text":"댁에","meaning":"府，贵府","explanation":"댁：府，贵府；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"댁","audio":"/audio/1ad485c2f73968fd25de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64392","senseId":"1","lemma":"댁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"댁에","audio":"/audio/b93b0183db3fa738c886.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"有时间","explanation":"한번：有时间。","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"3","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아","meaning":"拜访，寻访，探访","explanation":"찾다：拜访，寻访，探访；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"5","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아","audio":"/audio/e70a628817a54f0ec6b0.mp3"}},{"text":"뵙겠습니다.","meaning":"拜见","explanation":"뵙다：拜见；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"뵙다","audio":"/audio/3c13f85c4383e3b7b8c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62815","senseId":"1","lemma":"뵙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뵙겠습니다","audio":"/audio/5e389adbc770413db821.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"先生","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"加在某人的姓氏或职业之后，以表示对其的尊敬。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"1ad485c2f73968fd","term":"댁","zh":"府，贵府","audio":"/audio/1ad485c2f73968fd25de.mp3","entryId":"64392","definition":"(敬语)别人的家或家庭。","pronunciation":["댁"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"有时间","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"有机会的某个时候。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"拜访，寻访，探访","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了见某人或看某地而去相关场所。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"3c13f85c4383e3b7","term":"뵙다","zh":"拜见","audio":"/audio/3c13f85c4383e3b7b8c6.mp3","entryId":"62815","definition":"与长辈见面。","pronunciation":["뵙ː따","뷉ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fdd9c28dbb1251108b20.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73239-1-7-2","ko":"그러시지요. 언제든 환영입니다.","zh":"那当然，随时欢迎您来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러시지요.","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러시지요","audio":"/audio/6a438eb418c7e0c51645.mp3"}},{"text":"언제든","meaning":"随时","explanation":"언제든：无论什么时候都可以；这里表示随时欢迎。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"3","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제든","audio":"/audio/ff54d014f7d3bada141d.mp3"}},{"text":"환영입니다.","meaning":"欢迎","explanation":"환영：欢迎；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"환영","audio":"/audio/cbcf77839a2e8a913f96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73239","senseId":"1","lemma":"환영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환영입니다","audio":"/audio/66a5be977d7d98aab250.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0